 wave of mutations transforming humans into animals, François does everything he can to save his wife. As some of the creatures disappear into a nearby forest, he and their son Émile embark on a quest that will change their lives forever.","tagline":"All creatures crave freedom."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Un mal étrange frappe l'humanité : des mutations transforment les humains en animaux. Considérés comme dangereux car incontrôlables, ces humains mi-homme mi-animal sont placés dans des centres spécialisés. C'est le cas pour la mère d'Émile. Alors que Lana est transférée dans un centre, son bateau fait naufrage et elle disparaît. François la recherche et, à son tour, Émile se transforme.","tagline":"Toutes les créatures ont soif de liberté."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mTRz4UlKXUDxmfWrpefnjcQNsQV.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/H41DJiw7Q8xn6bWC75eyaavp9L.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":943134,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mTRz4UlKXUDxmfWrpefnjcQNsQV.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mTRz4UlKXUDxmfWrpefnjcQNsQV.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":2820},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mTRz4UlKXUDxmfWrpefnjcQNsQV.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mTRz4UlKXUDxmfWrpefnjcQNsQV.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":2820},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AalyJT09M59K8RfUnDhYopr8TOr.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/AalyJT09M59K8RfUnDhYopr8TOr.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1410},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3sGHojAE5E4gjgbFVpbRjrY555u.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3sGHojAE5E4gjgbFVpbRjrY555u.